{
  "_doc": "Octane classifier rules for Israeli vehicle registry. Rules eval top-to-bottom; first match wins. Rules with skip_if_cosmetic=true are skipped when the cosmetic guard fires (S-Line/AMG-Line/R-Line/etc.). LIKE pattern % = any chars, _ = single char.",
